{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國加州大學聖迭戈分校的工程師研製出一款完全由軟材料製成、依靠壓縮空氣驅動的六足機械人。該機械人最高速度可達每秒4.72米，約合每小時10.6英裏，是目前同類軟體機械人中速度最快的一款。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1587740.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T02:43:55.423481+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":98,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T02:32:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T02:37:15.075008+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T02:37:15.075008+00:00","content_hash":"e309488f74f1ce35683769bcf60510e40e3ccf6b763251ed51d1c3483fbeb8a2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}